KG42.register("clusters-c2c579482394ea621f682676",{"id":"48-multiple_energy_carrier_market::v142-d-K004","paper":"48-multiple_energy_carrier_market","label":"Participation-unit eligibility of assets that can be metered independently","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K004","label":"Participation-unit eligibility of assets that can be metered independently","market_meaning":"Within the scope, explicitly listed by R006, of a photovoltaic system or a building with photovoltaics and storage, an asset may act as a single market participation unit on the condition that it can be metered independently.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"This is limited to the participation instances and the independent-metering condition listed by the frozen chain; the node name is not generalized into a condition that every participant must supply energy, and software-agent or retailer duties are not added on this basis.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"This chain already has an explicit object scope, eligibility conditions, and a result of being able to participate, and it has an independent admission meaning. The current frozen chain has no complete interface from an asset to a software agent, a bid, or the operator, so the single-chain cluster is retained.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"It independently bears the listed asset instances and the independently meterable condition, and does not forcibly connect to the bidding or operational chain through shared wording."}],"connections":[],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K004-G001","category":"unverified_source","description":"The basis E003 for the participation unit and the independent-metering condition remains unverified, and only a candidate rule of limited scope is currently formed.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E003"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the participation instances and the metering conditions, without changing the frozen chain or the source status."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K004-G002","category":"upstream_missing","description":"E003 also lists standalone buildings and storage facilities and involves the asset owner dividing participation units, while R006 carries only some of those instances; the one-to-one software-agent relationship in E004 has also not entered the existing participation chain. The current candidate cannot cover every participant type or the complete participation interaction.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::V::participation.prosumer","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E003","v141-b-g01-E004"],"proposal_ids":["proposal:market-agent"],"required_work":"After verifying the source, the upstream is to make explicit the participant scope, asset division, and agent interface; D does not write the missing content in as new scientific objects."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K004-G003","category":"ontology_extension","description":"The software market agent, the retailer responsible for imports and exports of the external system, and the wholesale-market retail-agent interface all have unapproved proposals, and none has a corresponding frozen chain. They cannot be directly equated with the physical participation unit or the local operator, and the boundary between the two retailer proposals still needs to be judged.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::V::participation.prosumer"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E004","v141-b-g01-E005","v141-b-g03-E03"],"proposal_ids":["proposal:market-agent","proposal:retailer-role","v141-b-g03-P01"],"required_work":"Manually assess the relationship between the role proposal and the retail interface proposal, and then decide whether an upstream extension is needed; before approval, do not add nodes, interface edges, or role-identity mappings."}]},"rule_refs":["48-multiple_energy_carrier_market::v141-c-R006"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-bd381591ff94b49f"]});
